# Necromancy: "When this enchantment enters, if it's on the battlefield, it becomes an Aura ... Put target creature card
# from a graveyard onto the battlefield". The "if it's on the battlefield" is an intervening if (CR 603.4): with the trigger
# on the stack, Bot2 pays {1}{W} for Disenchant on the Necromancy; when the trigger would resolve the Necromancy is gone,
# so it does nothing and the Ornithopter that Bot1's Bolt killed stays in Bot2's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Lightning Bolt
Necromancy
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Disenchant
Island x15

